WEBVTT

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:32.330
"Smile Down the Runway"

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:46.160
So, what did you think of Ikuto Tsumura's show?

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:51.250
"Episode 11: The Promise"
Hmph. Actually... It wasn't bad.

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.830
I'm into clothes designed
with the wearer in mind.

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:56.290
Igarashi...

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:59.410
Since when did you get so soft?

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:03.330
How can I be a manager
if I can't give a fair evaluation?

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:10.000
Be right back.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.290
Make it quick. It's going to start soon.

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:19.580
Yes, yes... Thank you very much.

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:25.370
Yes of course. Hasegawa's schedule is wide open.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.160
Hey...

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:43.080
Can I talk to you both now?

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.040
No.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.200
What?

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.910
I'll be watching your show from the audience.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.330
I'll get going.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:54.750
Oh...

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.580
I'll see you later!

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.040
Mr. Ikuto!

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:01.700
Oh?

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.370
I'm going to do my best!

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:06.540
Yes.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.870
Oh? Hey.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:15.290
My phone died so could you use
your phone to record this one?

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.500
You're so cooperative.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.660
That model of yours.

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.910
She's never watched herself
walking on the runway before, right?

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:33.950
She should see it for herself.
How out of place she appears.

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:37.200
Do you really think they'll make it?

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:39.370
The designer's talents are questionable.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:43.870
Chiyuki Fujito won't feel fond
for Kokoro Hasegawa's designs.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:46.910
What can you expect from this last-minute team?

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.950
By fond...

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:52.540
Do you mean like the fondness
you have for Lale Faun?

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.660
You picking a fight now?

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:02.120
Hey, what is that?

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.410
Hey.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:11.580
I saw how you stopped shaking
when Ikuto talked to you.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.620
It wasn't like that.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:15.500
Give me a break.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.500
You and I are a team, but also rivals.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.660
Don't forget about our promise, got it?

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:28.450
Now that we're a team,
are you okay with that?

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:30.410
Ah... Y-Yes!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.000
Well, everything happens for a reason.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.000
So let's be nice to each other.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:35.950
Oh...

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:39.330
Hey, she's actually pretty nice.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.200
Hey.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:43.410
Those bags under your eyes...
Are you getting enough sleep?

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:46.080
Yes, I get plenty.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:50.370
I bet she went to work
with those eyes yesterday...

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.000
I know.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.870
Her goal isn't to be a model.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.700
She's really lovely.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:03.620
Small... and girly...

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:06.080
I wish I was, too...

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:07.910
Then...

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.830
I'm just going to tell you this right now.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.700
I'm still not completely satisfied
with this situation yet.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:19.830
I want to best you as a model.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:22.870
That's why... I want you to be in the show.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.040
Hey! Are you even listening?

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:32.700
A-Ah, I'm sorry. What was that?

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:35.000
She fell asleep...

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.950
But... Now's not the time to fight.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:41.370
I have to take the lead.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.410
How are you on production,
and what's your plan for the show?

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.500
She...

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:59.290
She tailored all of these to my size overnight?

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:04.290
She's a hard worker with talent and will-power.

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:08.790
If she put in all this passion
towards modeling...

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:11.910
I would be crushed.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.450
Miss Hasegawa.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:17.910
I want you to be in the show as a model, too.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.790
What...?

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.450
But... Why...?

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:24.160
No need to be soft.

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:28.660
She's the real deal. She can handle anything.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:32.200
We can't win with these clothes.
You need to remake them.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:35.830
Oh... But wait...

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.200
My brain can't keep up...

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:44.910
Walking the runway in these
bland outfits? It'd be a bore.

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:47.290
Change the show plan...

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:49.540
Do you have any ideas, Miss Fujito?

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:52.200
That's your job as the designer.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.580
If you really want to become one...

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:57.080
Don't let anyone else do that.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.750
Why are you being like this?!

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:05.580
Telling me to model... Telling me
what to do as a designer...

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:09.290
Wouldn't it defeat the purpose if I model?

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:12.250
The show is just around the corner.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:15.040
I... I...

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:17.450
I hate you!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:23.040
That's fine. I don't like you too
much either, Miss Hasegawa.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.160
Oh?

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:27.540
Like I said... We're not
collaborating as friends.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:29.500
Let's be a winning team.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:38.870
These designs... I think they're fun.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:41.160
R-Really...?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:45.540
Yup. The theme is "waku,"
excitement. Looks good.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:46.790
But...

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:51.790
This plan would put a lot on you as the model.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:55.540
My ability as a clothes-maker
isn't enough to win.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:56.750
So...

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:57.700
Oh?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.160
I need your walk to be beautiful!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:05.000
So beautiful that it blows my mind, please!

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:10.500
Hey, enough with that polite speech.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.500
Ah...

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:15.080
There's no need to speak like that to models.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:18.910
You can count on me for the walk. But...

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:24.160
You better design clothes that
blow my mind, too, Miss Designer.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.950
Yeah, I'll do my best!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.200
Could you check my walk?

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.330
Thoughts?

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.700
Um...

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.580
Could you emphasize the shape of the clothes...

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:39.660
How's this?

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.040
Hmm...

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:44.080
Could you move your
lower body more elegantly?

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:44.950
How about this?

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:48.580
The lower body looks good,
but the upper body lacks energy...

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.500
Ugh...

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.120
--Hey!
--Huh?

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:55.290
The shoulder's still too tight.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.580
This is the third time.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:00.040
Sorry, I'll fix it right away.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.620
Try this!

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.870
Check this.

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:14.040
Good... It's been fixed.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.200
What?

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:19.410
What do you mean you have
a modeling gig tomorrow?

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:22.450
The day before the show is crucial!

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:28.200
But... My manager said I couldn't
get out of this one beforehand.

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.830
Why are you so loyal to Igarashi?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:33.160
She's always treated you poorly.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:35.290
Stop!

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:38.870
I'm grateful for her!

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:41.950
She helped me foster confidence in myself.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.080
On my first day as a model,

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:48.160
I wore a suit to work.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:50.620
Ms. Igarashi saw that and said...

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.160
You're serious and have great posture.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:56.370
Your limbs are long, and your head is small.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:58.830
And above all, you're very tall.

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:02.290
Women who look good in suits make good models.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:09.000
She's the first person who complimented
what I hated about my body.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.700
That's why...

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.540
Okay.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:17.950
Do what you want. But it's all on you
if you run out of time.

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:21.580
I know. I won't distract you, Chiyuki.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:25.370
Actually, could you please help me?!

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:27.200
You gotta be kidding me!

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.580
I'm sorry...

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:31.450
You should've asked earlier, dummy!

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:34.790
You said I was on my own...

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.790
To get approval from Igarashi,
who thinks talent is everything...

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:41.540
...you have to compete against me
so I can surpass you.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.330
That's why...

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:47.160
If you're going to walk...
I'll listen to any requests.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.750
Hey, Chiyuki...

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:57.200
I... actually have a favor to ask.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:58.660
Huh?

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.450
This is it.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.450
Yup.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:16.910
Ah, this model... She was in that show!

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:24.370
The outfit's rather simple as the opener.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:30.290
Anyway... Who are those people
and what's with the rack?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.910
Wow!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:48.290
They're changing outfits on the runway.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:54.950
This designer's going to make this model
walk for the whole collection.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:12:00.200
The model transforms
without showing her bare skin.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:04.370
Changing by adding and removing elements.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:07.500
Something that simple can still transform a lot!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:13.290
Kokoro... Since when did you get so bold?

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:22.200
Earlier, by lowering her center, she was able to
move her hips and legs to emphasize the pleats.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:27.660
This time, she stabilizes her core to bring
attention towards the lines of her upper body.

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:30.080
Impressive transformations.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:33.450
That dress from earlier is now a shirt.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.370
It's going to change again.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:40.160
Walking is acting...

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:45.500
You have to highlight the features
of the outfit with your walk.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:50.160
That model is acting out
different roles for every outfit.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.660
Without a break.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.620
I would never agree to do this.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.700
We finally made it this far.

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:04.870
Our eyes just met.

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:07.870
She's not focused on the runway.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:10.250
Just watch, she's going to fall.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.910
<i>Smile Down the Runway.</i>

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:20.580
Huh?

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:24.700
What was the walk for the next outfit...?

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:25.950
Oh, no...

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.950
--Wow...
--Wow...

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.540
I remember now...

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:42.580
Setting aside whether it'll be
a good walk or not...

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:45.620
She'll never mess up that bad.

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:50.330
Walking was something she continued
to practice ever since she was little.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:58.080
She understands, more than anyone,
how a model is useless if she can't even walk.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.750
And plus...

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:04.080
This collection is fun.

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:11.080
Harmony of the energetic orange
cardigan and the elegant coat...

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.000
This one is a playful walk.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:19.700
She'll eventually focus on
walking on the runway.

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:20.910
See?

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:27.540
They switched racks...
It's a different outfit now.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:30.290
A whole new set of transformations!

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.830
Oh, man...

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.620
This is so fun!

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:38.700
Wow...

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:44.290
Well this sure is exciting...
Just as their concept says.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:00.410
Six variations...?

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:06.700
I was impressed with the four from the first
half. And now they've added even more.

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:10.580
All of the designs are rather simple...

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.950
But they're fun.

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:14.870
And is it just me...

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:16.700
...or does something feel strange...?

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:19.790
It's a deception.

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:23.580
She made the fitters short and the racks low.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:28.580
That's how she's hiding the model's height.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.000
What an eye sore...

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:34.950
I can't handle watching this hopeless model
and incompetent designer.

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:38.660
Igarashi. You of all people
can't leave right now.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.620
The results will speak for themselves.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:45.160
It doesn't matter if I'm here or not.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:47.870
Stay right here.

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:52.370
I'll never forgive you if you leave.

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.000
Don't be ridiculous.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:57.620
You can say that because
you're on the winning side.

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:00.080
She's starting to lose momentum.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.660
She's done more than ten walks with heels

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.620
that are higher than usual to
compensate for her height.

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:08.120
She's barely holding it together.

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:09.910
It's starting to get really obvious.

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.660
Oh...

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.250
I'm getting distracted...

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:17.080
Nobody wants that model!

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:23.660
Ah... Just like that time!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:29.500
Igarashi... Look.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.790
Ah.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.540
Didn't I tell you?

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:37.660
Sometimes her aura can be surprisingly great.

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:44.290
What... That aura...

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.290
She just lacks the height.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.250
That's all.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:52.580
That's why I can't bring myself
to tell her to quit.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.000
Hey, Kokoro.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.080
I want you to add one more
outfit to this collection.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.870
The concept is...

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.750
"Wind."

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:16.790
It's fun... It's so fun!

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:19.330
I want to win!

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.540
I want to win.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:25.000
I want to prove them wrong!

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:30.870
What? Who's that model...?

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:37.250
All this time, we didn't notice...

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:39.540
...how small that model was.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:44.950
I have a favor to ask you, Chiyuki.

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.330
Huh?

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.370
If you do this, I'll walk the runway too--

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:50.370
Okay.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.540
What?

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.040
Like I said...

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:57.000
If you'll walk, I'll listen to any requests.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.410
Oh...

00:17:58.410 --> 00:17:59.700
Okay.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:04.450
I'll win...

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:06.750
And make you a designer.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:08.750
Wow...

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:09.910
She's beautiful.

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:10.830
Ah...

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:13.250
She's got a great figure.

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:16.040
Far above the average person.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:17.950
But I gotta say.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:21.950
It's amazing how we didn't notice
how small the other model was.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:25.250
Yes, her presence is powerful.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.950
She's small, but she can make herself look big.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:34.080
Chiyuki Fujito is my past...

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:38.410
A mediocre child with a hopeless dream.

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:39.580
That's why...

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:47.120
So Kokoro... What's the favor?

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:50.750
I want to make two more outfits.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:53.250
Ah... Igarashi...

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:54.660
Your suit...

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:04.370
Ms. Igarashi. I'll be wearing the same suit
down the runway at the Geika Festival.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:08.450
I don't mind if you throw it out...
It's okay if you do...

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:12.080
But will you please try it on just once?

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:19.830
All this struggle...
This never-ending struggle...

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:24.410
I can only see you as my past self
scrambling after a hopeless dream.

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:27.910
Hasegawa...

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:31.000
You were my dream...

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:44.250
I'm... sorry...

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:51.450
Hey, Shizuku.

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:54.500
Does this suit look good on me?

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.660
Yeah.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:03.160
It would've been easier if she'd bad-mouthed me.

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:08.910
Oh my god! The designer "Kokoro Hasegawa"
was that girl Kokoro?!

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:10.080
Do you know her?

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:14.250
Yeah, we used to be represented
by the same agency.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.500
But... The Kokoro I know...

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:21.120
...was cold and standoffish.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:25.160
I don't remember her aura being so warm...

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:31.910
Hey, don't cry during the show.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:34.660
I'm not... crying...

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:39.160
You look rough yourself.
Could you even do one more walk?

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:43.750
Who do you think I am?

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:47.700
What...? That jacket is part
of the next outfit...?

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:56.250
They were more than just a short model
and an incompetent designer.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:59.790
Eccentric ideas that held
the audience's attention.

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:05.160
The excitement of anticipating
the next outfit never waned.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:08.910
Now... It's time for the finale.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.120
Wow!

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.200
Wow!

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:24.120
Ah... I can hear the applause...

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.750
Wow...

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.000
Wow...!

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:51.370
That tiny model... I could use her.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:56.160
So what Kokoro really wants
is to be a designer...

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:57.830
I see...

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:03.540
I know... this isn't a fair battle.

00:22:03.540 --> 00:22:08.250
My 14 walks down the runway won
against only one from Kokoro.

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:09.750
But even so...

00:22:09.750 --> 00:22:11.750
Ah...

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:12.910
Ah!

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:19.040
See that?! Nobody was watching you at all!

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:24.370
You lost to me. That means you
aren't that talented as a model!

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:28.870
You should put all your effort
into becoming a designer!

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:35.910
I won... I won... I won...

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:40.250
There's a possibility that I can
succeed as a model...

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:43.660
I still have a chance...!

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:48.410
Thank you... Chiyuki.

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:25.080
Now... It's your turn, Toh.

00:24:31.500 --> 00:24:33.950
Next, "This Is My Story."

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:36.910
"See you next time!!"
